# Fixture tests compare autofix output byte for byte, and the fix engine emits
# `\n`. A Windows checkout that rewrote the fixtures to CRLF would fail those
# comparisons for reasons unrelated to the rule under test.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The bench robustness cases encode their line endings and byte order mark on
# purpose: normalising them would turn the case into a copy of a neighbour.
bench/cases/i-robustness/crlf-and-tab-indent.yml -text
bench/cases/i-robustness/bom-prefixed.yml -text
